# Daily rewards (the Reward Shrine, after Tibia's): a seven-day cycle.
# Each line is one choice for its day; a day with several lines lets the
# player pick one. Claiming on consecutive days walks the cycle; missing a
# day starts it over.
#
# day  item_type  amount   (comment)
1  1088001  1     # Meteor
1  721331   3     # Life potions (3000 HP)
